{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the impact of using imagenet_vit_l as the image encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup, replacing resnet50 from config_033. The validation accuracy of 0.725 exceeds the previous resnet50-based baseline (0.713), suggesting the image encoder choice may influence performance. However, the exact contribution of this change versus other design elements remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence."
}

